{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tech the grab or die trying!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of Schwarzerblitz and Motionsickness, here comes a new, fast paced, explosive, 1v1 fighting game, where <strong>every grab is lethal</strong>. Roll around, wait for an opening and smash your opponent on the tarmac (explosions might ensue)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/3a192a52e845462ec9cbb6f5314225b7.poster.avif?t=1771612709\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/3a192a52e845462ec9cbb6f5314225b7.webm?t=1771612709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/3a192a52e845462ec9cbb6f5314225b7.mp4?t=1771612709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's judo until it isn't</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grabs are the way, but this doesn't mean one cannot fight dirty! Each character has a super move at their disposal, be it an invincible grab, a counter attack or a full screen pew pew laser, that immediately seals the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/16cea2109af24cc51981086aa388262c.poster.avif?t=1771612709\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/16cea2109af24cc51981086aa388262c.webm?t=1771612709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/16cea2109af24cc51981086aa388262c.mp4?t=1771612709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strive for victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use strikes to create grab opportunities, roll around the stage to position yourself, grab at the right moment to seal the deal. <strong>No block, no rest, only movement, fundamentals and a generous amount of dirt. </strong>Do you have what it takes to become the master of Exploding Judo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/63c70168b623446ee8f1212f0f09aa6d.poster.avif?t=1771612709\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/63c70168b623446ee8f1212f0f09aa6d.webm?t=1771612709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/extras/63c70168b623446ee8f1212f0f09aa6d.mp4?t=1771612709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All of this with the help of...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >full 3D movement with the help of a Roll button. This is a five buttons game (punch, kick, grab, dash, roll) with emphasis on dodging and grabbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 standard characters plus 3 unlockable boss characters and an annoying gun-headed goon that cannot beat the champ even if he tries his best (well, unless he gets really, REALLY lucky with a random grab)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arcade mode, survival mode and time attack mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ten stages plus the classic grid (duh) and an extra <strong>green screen stage for photobashing shenanigans</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >local versus (online modes unfortunately not planned)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tutorial and training mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a psychopathic dabbing killer robot reinstalled into a bunny droid body (which is actually canon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>a giant kaiju robot with plasma chainsaws and a full screen laser</strong> (which is ALSO canon, if you care about this sort of stuff)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the one and only <strong>Callowman from</strong> <strong>Duels of Fortune</strong> as a special playable guest character!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Dojo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806150/c08e4d948edbcb91c237bd2ca2d76e8d1b886e25.jpg"},{"name":"A Taste of Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806150/a141e07575717390ef70e8f5eabfb9902881602f.jpg"},{"name":"Above the Clouds, We Found no God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806150/555d45754131c521a1a664c600c6b0dc29c687d8.jpg"},{"name":"The Man with the Machine Gun Head","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806150/3ecc3d235b6bc785b653efa680275c29e617e16a.jpg"},{"name":"Exploding Judo Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806150/9cc8440bbe49d79a19990c5340f562ca0b9d7c2f.jpg"},{"name":"73=47","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806150/ba6b20c2a45642fe03ef82eac97530e04e644bbd.jpg"},{"name":"FLASHBACK!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806150/245fdcebd189031048caa11166ce090a0cae066d.jpg"},{"name":"DIAMOND CRUSHER!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806150/4436f346213f8c8ca6a0bfccebbfe0c8638ff198.jpg"},{"name":"TASTE MY DESPAIR!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806150/28aec03d91531a2c5d5c4e88a56304d28afd16dc.jpg"},{"name":"Interference","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806150/359c88eac246214a1eb26717e8db470e183d5902.jpg"}],"total":41},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806150?t=1771612709","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806150?t=1771612709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/b6f6f1e175f7c1405ce40085058084c1efc4f63b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771612709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806150/b6f6f1e175f7c1405ce40085058084c1efc4f63b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771612709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Small amounts of coarse language, small amounts of innuendo (not explicit)"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tech the grab or die trying!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of Schwarzerblitz and Motionsickness, here comes a new, fast paced, explosive, 1v1 fighting game, where <strong>every grab is lethal</strong>. Roll around, wait for an opening and smash your opponent on the tarmac (explosions might ensue)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app